    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Devant l\u2019insistance de son fr\u00e8re Joseph, qu\u2019il n\u2019a pas revu depuis vingt-cinq ans, Paolo se r\u00e9sout \u00e0 abandonner quelques jours sa vie calme et harmonieuse au Canada, pour revenir \u00e0 Marseille au chevet de son p\u00e8re accident\u00e9. Il part donc, son fils sous le bras, bien d\u00e9cid\u00e9 \u00e0 ne pas s\u2019attarder dans cette ville qu\u2019il a fui, des ann\u00e9es plus t\u00f4t, \u00e0 la suite d\u2019un drame. Il n\u2019imagine pas, alors, que l\u2019affection de sa famille retrouv\u00e9e, sa rencontre amoureuse avec une jeune femme et la solidarit\u00e9 joyeuse et simple des Marseillais le r\u00e9concilieront avec cette ville qu\u2019il n\u2019aurait jamais voulu quitter... Marseille.",
        "english": "Under pressure from his brother Joseph, who he hasn't seen for twenty-five years, Paolo resigns himself to leaving his calm and harmonious life in Canada behind for a few days and to return to Marseille to his dying father's bedside. He leaves, with his son, determined to not linger in this city which he fled many years earlier after a dramatic episode. But he hadn't taken into account the affection bestowed upon him by his family, rediscovered after all these years, or the encounter with a young woman, not to mention the joyful and simple solidarity of Marseille folk, all of which will reconcile him to this city that he once never would have wanted to leave... Marseille."
    },
